WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.308
- THERE HE IS.
- HEY, HEY, HEY, WHAT'S UP?

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:10.110
- HEY, MAN.
WHAT UP, MAN?

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.012
- HEY, HERE'S THE DEAL.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:16.916
100%, GRASS-FED JAPANESE
KOBE BEEF, $35 A POUND.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.518
- THAT'S WHAT
I'M TALKING ABOUT.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:21.221
ALL RIGHT, LET'S GRILL
THESE LITTLE HOMEYS UP.

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:24.190
- ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT,
IS THAT GROUND CHUCK, MAN?

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.292
NO OFFENSE, I AIN'T
TRYING TO PARK MY BENTLEY

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.661
NEXT TO YOUR TOYOTA,
YOU KNOW WHAT I'M SAYING?

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.530
- COME ON, MAN.
- OH, YOU JUST PUTTING THEM

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.032
RIGHT NEXT
TO THE FROZEN PATTIES.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.666
YEAH, ALL RIGHT.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.168
- HEY, RELAX, MAN.
I'M GONNA COOK THEM GOOD.

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:36.669
- OKAY, YEAH.

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:38.638
- ALL RIGHT, SO HOW'S
TERESA DOING?

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:40.440
- SHE'S GOOD. SHE'S GOOD.
SHE'S SAD SHE COULDN'T BE HERE.

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:42.208
YOU KNOW,
SHE'S GOT A CLOSING TODAY.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.044
YOU WANT TO FLASH-COOK THOSE,
BECAUSE THEY REAL LEAN.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.912
YOU KNOW, THEY'RE GRASS-FED.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:47.981
SO YOU JUST WANT TO PROBABLY
FLIP THEM RIGHT--RIGHT NOW.

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:49.649
ALL RIGHT.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.251
- HEY, WHO WANTS CHEESE
ON THEIR BURGER?

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:53.153
- NOBODY, NOBODY.
NOBODY WANTS CHEESE.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:54.621
- ANYBODY WANT
A DOUBLE BURGER?

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:56.356
- NO, NOBODY WANTS
A DOUBLE BURGER.

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.625
THAT'S LIKE PUTTING
A DIAMOND RING ON A PIG HOOF.

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:00.693
I'M SORRY, BUT THE GRASS
THAT THESE COWS ATE

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.130
COSTS MORE THAN THIS HOUSE.
- ALL RIGHT, NO DOUBLE BURGERS.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:06.132
- NO DOUBLE BURGERS--
- HEY, WHAT THE HELL?

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:07.400
- YOU MAY AS WELL
JUST POOP ON THAT.

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:08.935
- WHAT?

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:11.071
- YOU JUST KETCHUP-RAPED
MY KOBE BURGER.

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:14.307
THIS WAS A MISTAKE.
THIS--NO, NO.

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:16.142
NO, NO. UH-UH. NO, NO, NO,
NO, NO, NO, NO.

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.411
SEE, THIS MEAT
CAME ALL THE WAY OVER HERE

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:22.148
FROM THE PACIFIC OCEAN
BY BOAT,

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:26.386
BECAUSE THE AIR PRESSURE
WOULD RUIN ITS INTEGRITY.

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:27.854
GIVE ME THAT.

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:29.856
YOU ARE NOT WORTHY.

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:31.424
YOU'LL NEVER LEARN.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.126
THIS IS RIDIC--
THIS IS $126--

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:35.962
THIS LITTLE MOTHER--

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:39.265
$126 WORTH OF BEEF.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:42.368
Y'ALL NOT WORTHY.

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.270
- DID HE TAKE MY DOG?

